WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,300
Little darling

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,430
What's your name?

3
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:10,060
Whatever her parents call her, she will

4
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:12,060
Did you tell me to shut up?

5
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,640
My name is Lin Shiyu

6
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,640
The one above is Yuyu’s father

7
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:19,600
My mother’s name is Qin Ya

8
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:23,100
Do you still have lollipops?

9
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:27,870
Yuyu wants to eat something with strawberry flavor.

10
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:30,160
It's all over now

11
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:35,130
I am your biological child

12
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:36,130
My daughter is three years old

13
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:37,130
I won’t eat any of it
